The upstream project is a set of guided Amazon Bedrock AgentCore workshops. This
repository reworks two of those workshops into deployable, reusable templates
targeting ap-northeast-1 (Tokyo) and Japanese-language workloads. The
modifications are described in the "What I changed" section of README.md and are
recorded in this repository's commit history.

